# On Storage server in Stratos DC create a new branch xfusioncorp_cluster from master branch in /usr/src/kodekloudrepos/cluster git repo. 

# On the Storage Server, go to the repository and create the new branch from master: 

```bash 
cd /usr/src/kodekloudrepos/cluster
git checkout master
git branch xfusioncorp_cluster
```
This will:

Ensure you are on the master branch.

Create a new branch named xfusioncorp_cluster from master.

Verify:
git branch
You should see:
* master
  xfusioncorp_cluster
